    "body": "Merge-batch refresh: merged `upstream/main` into the branch (merge commit a283310a, no rebase, no force).\n\nHand-resolved hunk (one): `crates/app/src/commands/operation/gates.rs`, `family_gate`. Main's #532 wire EDM refusal block and this PR's #1291 `mounted`/`clause` lines were added at the same place. I kept both: main's wire block first, then `mounted`/`clause`, then the plasma and fallback refusals that use `{clause}`. No other conflicts.\n\nGate on the merged tree:\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --lib`: 148 passed\n- `turning` 6, `machine_switch` 6, `plasma_profile` 7, `wire_contour` 7, `refusal_ghost` 4, `post_serves_kind` 5: all passed\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean\n\nReady for a delta review of the remerge-diff (`git show --remerge-diff a283310a`).\n",
