    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: a283310a267277a3902e1ee8db4d4144a02e0bda -->\n**Delta review (M3) of the merge-batch refresh: ready for the maintainer to merge.**\n- The remerge-diff of a283310a has one hand-resolved hunk, in `crates/app/src/commands/operation/gates.rs` `family_gate`. It keeps both sides in order: main's #532 wire-EDM block first, then this PR's #1291 `mounted`/`clause` wording, then the plasma check and the fallback. Nothing from either side is dropped.\n- The author's gate on this head is green: app lib 148, `turning` 6, `machine_switch` 6, `plasma_profile` 7, `wire_contour` 7, `refusal_ghost` 4, `post_serves_kind` 5, and clippy is clean.\n- Not blocking: main's wire block still says \"the setup's machine is a {label}\" when no machine is mounted, the same flaw #1291 fixes elsewhere. It is out of scope here; worth a P7.\n",
